     "Look at oganesson-294", {{"Z", "118"}, {"N", "176"}, {"zoom", "0"}}},
    {"2012", "CERN, Switzerland and France", "The Higgs boson", "The Large Hadron Collider found the Higgs boson, a piece of the field that gives electrons and quarks their mass. Most of a proton’s weight does not come from its quarks, though: it comes from the energy of the strong force that holds them together.",
