    {"2013", "A European team led by Aneta Stodolna", "An electron wave, seen on a detector", "Physicists used a special microscope to capture the interference pattern of a hydrogen atom’s electron wave, with its rings and dark gaps. It is a pattern recorded on a detector, evidence for the electron’s wave, not a picture of a cloud like the ones in this lab: those are worked out from the theory.",
